@startuml

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class "Party\n(legal entity)" as Party {
  permits : set | every type
}
class "Business unit\n(desk)" as Desk {
  permits : set | inherits
}
class "Book" as Book {
  carries : set | inherits
}

class "Portfolio" as Portfolio {
  aggregates books
  decides who may see
}

Party --> Desk : subset or equal
Desk --> Book : subset or equal
Book ..> Portfolio : placed in, no approval

note right of Portfolio
  A book moves between portfolios as an
  administrative act. A set that followed
  the folder would change with it, which
  no approval process allows.
end note

@enduml
